text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C30C6 {
    "Even those POKéMON that can swim are\ncarried along by the rapid currents."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C3110 {
    "Aiyeeeeh!"
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C311A {
    "I think POKéMON enjoy the fast-running\ncurrents around these parts."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C315E {
    "My LUVDISC are looking for a fun\nmatch. Will you join us?"
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C3198 {
    "Oopsie!"
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C31A0 {
    "There’s a collector who’s after the\nSCALES of LUVDISC."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C31D7 {
    "Okeydokey! That’s enough rest, gang!\nIt’s time for a match!"
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C3213 {
    "Tuckered out again..."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C3229 {
    "My BIRD POKéMON get tired quickly after\na long flight..."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C3262 {
    "You’re a POKéMON TRAINER.\nNo need for words. We battle now."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C329E {
    "... ... ... ... ... ... ...\n... ... ... ... ... ... ..."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C32D6 {
    "It was I who challenged you, and yet\nI lost. I am deeply shamed..."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C3319 {
    "The savage tide in this area serves to\nmake us stronger than ever."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C335C {
    "I concede defeat."
}

text Naranja_Route134_G00_M49_Text_081C336E {
    "We will return for more training at\nMETEOR FALLS.\pIf you’d like, you should go, too.\nIt will definitely toughen you up!"
}
